WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.460
To find a fraction of a quantity, divide into denominator-sized groups, then take the

00:00:05.460 --> 00:00:06.963
numerator number of groups.

00:00:07.783 --> 00:00:16.103
Calculate 6/8 of 24. The answer is 18. One 8th of 24 is 3; multiply by 6 to get 18.

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:22.525
2/3 of 24 reading cards are used during a library project. How many cards is that?

00:00:22.525 --> 00:00:24.267
Pause the video and think.

00:00:25.117 --> 00:00:30.909
2/3 of 24 reading cards are used during a library project. How many cards is that?

00:00:30.909 --> 00:00:36.701
The answer is 16. One 3th of 24 is 8; multiply by 2 to get 16.
